{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1222612001:1":{"text":"발 디딜 틈이 없군! 다들 조심해.","source_cn":"简直乱得下不去脚！你们小心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x787162A19F529AB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222612002:1":{"text":"마스터는 아주 민첩하시다고욥...!! 으아아아아!","source_cn":"主人的身手可是很敏捷的——哇呀呀呀！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCA90A3A42E8D61EC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터는 아주 민첩하시다고욥...!! 으아아아아!","female":"마스터는 아주 민첩하시다고욥...!! 으아아아아!","variant_male_record_index":"138990","variant_female_record_index":"138991","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222612003:1":{"text":"으아, 아파라... 여기에 웬 서랍이죠?","source_cn":"疼死了……这里怎么会有个抽屉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AFD02D1B2832668","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222612004:1":{"text":"수납장 안에 있던 물건들이 전부 바닥에 떨어져 있어요. 서랍도 그렇고요.","source_cn":"柜子里的东西全都倒在地上了，连抽屉都没放过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD6291AD7D56CD8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222612005:1":{"text":"이곳을 뒤지다가 무슨 소리를 듣고 도망친 것 같군.","source_cn":"看着像是听到了什么风吹草动，于是翻到一半就跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA355CD512265EFF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222612006:1":{"text":"그렇다는 건, 상대방이 다시 돌아올 확률이 높다는 거네요! 이곳에 숨어서 기다리면 사냥감이 걸려들지도 모르겠어요.","source_cn":"这意味着对方返回的概率很高。我们在这里蹲守，说不定会有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90DE9B7ABA937A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222612007:1":{"text":"그럼 운을 한 번 시험해 보도록 하지! 일단 숨어보자고.","source_cn":"那就试试运气吧！我们找个地方埋伏起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7986C040D78789D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"루카","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}